#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/the-end.md:2
msgid "练习峰，登顶"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/the-end.md:4
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"从 {doc}`introduction` 的出发宣言，到 {doc}`fc-layer-basics` 的赤手空拳，{doc}`cnn-"
"basics` 的发现装备，{doc}`dataset-preparation` 的打包行囊，{doc}`neural-training-"
"basics` 的登山纪律，{doc}`le-net` 的首登，{doc}`exp-cmp` 的登山日志——你爬完了第一座山。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/the-end.md:6
msgid "登山上篇教会了你什么"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/the-end.md:9
msgid "**不是\"CNN 有几层\"，而是\"为什么 CNN 比全连接更适合图像\"。**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/the-end.md:11
#, python-brace-format
msgid "全连接的 20 万参数不是\"算力不够\"——是**压根不看山体结构**（{ref}`inductive-bias`）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/the-end.md:12
msgid "CNN 用 320 个参数做到全连接 20 万参数的事——**把山的形状刻进装备里**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/the-end.md:13
msgid "LeNet 证明：练习峰，可以爬"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/the-end.md:14
msgid "登山日志用数据说话：赤手空拳 vs 冰镐绳索——山不会听理论，山只看数据"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/the-end.md:19
msgid "下一步：两件事"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/the-end.md:21
msgid "第一件：拆开看看"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/the-end.md:23
msgid "你登顶了。但登山者不满足于\"知道什么有用\"——他们想知道：**每件装备到底贡献了多少？**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/the-end.md:25
msgid "把卷积层拆掉会跌多少？换掉激活函数呢？去掉 Dropout 呢？"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/the-end.md:27
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{doc}`../ablation-study/index`——**拆。一件一件拆。** "
"这是科学：控制变量，数据说话。从\"我会用\"到\"我理解为什么\"——这是一次思维跃迁。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/the-end.md:29
msgid "第二件：换一座山"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/the-end.md:31
msgid "MNIST 是 28×28 的灰度手写数字。现实世界的山比这大 1,000 倍。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/the-end.md:33
msgid "ImageNet——140 万张彩色照片，1,000 个类别。这座山在 2012 年之前从未有人登顶。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/the-end.md:35
msgid "你带着练习峰上积累的每一滴经验，去面对一座真正配得上\"未登峰\"之名的山。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/the-end.md:37
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{doc}`../image-net-era/introduction`——**走。真正的攀登，现在开始。**"
msgstr ""

